  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------ v0.7a: the network desks (network room, device CLI in netcli.js)
     These desks have `net`: the console is your workstation ADM-WS01, you `ssh` to the devices and every command runs in the CLI simulator.
     Rules with `match` run on the workstation (or anywhere, with `anywhere: true`: the on-site requests); rules with `on` react to what a
     device did (its tags). The flags in net.flags are read from the devices after every command. See docs/scenario-format.md. */
